<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-REVISED WOMEN'S 10 KMS WALK RESULT.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-REVISED WOMEN'S 10 KMS WALK RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revised result of last</p>
<p>Thursday's women's 10 kms walk final after the disqualification</p>
<p>of silver medallist Olimpiada Ivanova of Russia for doping:</p>
<p> 1. Annarita Sidoti (Italy)	     42:55.49</p>
<p> 2. Olga Kardopoltseva (Belarus)	43:30.20</p>
<p> 3. Valentina Tsybulskaya (Belarus)   43:49.24</p>
<p> 4. Liu Hongyu (China)		    43:56.86</p>
<p> 5. Erica Alfridi (Italy)		 43:59.73</p>
<p> 6. Anika Szebenszky (Hungary)	  44:14.94</p>
<p> 7. Gu Yan (China)			  44:24.17</p>
<p> 8. Anita Liepina (Latvia)		45:00.56</p>
<p> 9.. Yelena Nikolayeva (Russia)	 45:01.90</p>
<p> 10. Elisabetta Perrone (Italy)	 45:16.64</p>
<p> 11. Maria Urbanik-Rosza (Hungary)    45:36.57</p>
<p> 12. Wang Yan (China)		     46:21.69</p>
<p> 13. Svetlana Tolstaya (Kazakhstan)   47:09.51</p>
<p> 14. Yuka Mitsumori (Japan)	     47:24.22</p>
<p>Disqualified:</p>
<p>Oliampiada Ivanova (Russia)</p>
<p>Irina Stankina (Russia)</p>
<p>Maya Sazanova (Kazakhstan)</p>
<p>Olga Panfyorova (Russia)</p>
<p>Did not finish:</p>
<p>Beate Gunmelt (Germany)</p>
</text>
